<title>UK: ABN AMRO sets 200 mln euro Eurobond.</title>
<headline>ABN AMRO sets 200 mln euro Eurobond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following subordinated bond was announced by lead manager ABN AMRO Hoare Govett.</p>
<p> BORROWER   ABN AMRO BANK</p>
<p> AMT  **200 MLN EURO  COUPON     6.375     MATURITY    25.APR.07</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.10    PAY DATE    19.FEB.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.0	 REOFFER    99.50     SPREAD	+40 BP</p>
<p> NOTES    **UNTIL INTRODUCTION OF EURO'S ALL PAYMENTS WILL BE</p>
<p>		IN ECU. CONVERSION ON BASIS OF 1 ECU = 1 EURO</p>
<p> MOODY	AA2	 LISTING    AMST/LUX  PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AA-	 DENOMS (K) 1-10	SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    DUTCH     HOME CTRY  N/LANDS   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.40	SELL CONC  1.60	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
